abstract: >
  Portable agent-led GitHub repository workflows through a Python command
  interface and the CTO Legends router. Supports repository audits, README
  improvements, licensing review, metadata, search research, community health,
  releases, portfolio presentation, and social-preview upload preparation and
  verification. Optional integrations provide measured search evidence; social
  uploads use the agent host's supported browser or file-picker tools.
